{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08064","headline":"门有车马客行 · 李白","name":"门有车马客行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门有车马宾，金鞍曜朱轮。\n谓从丹霄落，乃是故乡亲。\n呼儿扫中堂，坐客论悲辛。\n对酒两不饮，停觞泪盈巾。\n叹我万里游，飘飘三十春。\n空谈帝王略，紫绶不挂身。\n雄劒藏玉匣，阴符生素尘。\n廓落无所合，流离湘水滨。\n借问宗党间，多爲泉下人。\n生苦百战役，死托万鬼隣。\n北风扬胡沙，埋翳周与秦。\n大运且如此，苍穹宁匪仁。\n恻怆竟何道，存亡任大钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}